            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Personally, for the use case I have in mind, I think the \"diff\" display should be simplified and only show inline what changed rather than an actual unified diff view, and the view should be very easy to dismiss, or even automatic, so that editing is not disrupted. In my plugin it disappears on a timer or on cursor move.",
