        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "It would also be nice to have a three-way diff when the buffer and file are changed at the same time, so instead of `WARNING: The file has been changed since reading it!!!` the user could opt for a git-like merge with the original buffer state as the base, and the current buffer and file system states as the competing versions. And hopefully some kind of auto merge would be possible (built-in or via a plugin) when there aren't any conflicts",
